  Text: "There's green stuff and wrecked equipment everywhere.\n\nA big dark glass
    case labeled <link>VESSEL Q7-016</link> is shattered on the side. It's empty...\n
    \nThere's a code printed on the inside: <link>E-CODE b02i2E90L</link>. \n\nUnless
    that thing carried green goo exclusively, some <link>thing</link> is out there,
    Boss. \n\nThe cargo got out."
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
